{
 "note": "Design round 9c, feature pickaxe (The pickaxe's material follows the model), the option chosen: pick-tiers-full. rows are copied from the design's pickaxe.json, verbatim. The first five are the full HUD of build-9c.cjs: hud4.js MIX.render on the situation's state with the fable-boss option, colour style, left-aligned, with the 1.0.0 frame; hotbar cols 17-20 (the pickaxe and the effort numeral) recoloured by the option. They predate the totem (build.cjs's machinery draws 1.0's HUD), so they are Hungerbar's with hud.totem off; with it on, each also has the totem in hotbar slot 5. The sixth row, p-lineup, is no engine state: build-9c.cjs cut hotbar slot 1 (cols 16-21) from each model's own render at effort high (Fable 5.1 with its scoped week, Opus 5.5, Sonnet 4.5, Haiku 4.5, Codex) and set the five side by side, each followed by its family's name in grey, so its situation has no state (null) and ctx.lineup names the models. situations are the design's inputs. Kamal's pick (picks-r9.json picks9c): pick-tiers-full, the default of hud.pickaxe (tiers).",
